--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 8  | Text: 心力其实就是延迟满足
Segment #2   [00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,380] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 10 | Text: 你做一件事的恒心不定
Segment #3   [00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:04,600] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 你在过程中容易动摇
Segment #4   [00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,000] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 是因为你没有前瞻性
Segment #5   [00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,820] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 13 | Text: 就是你不知道这件事做成了会意味着
Segment #6   [00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,240] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 就比如说我身边
Segment #7   [00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,860] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 我觉得我当年刚来澳门的时候
Segment #8   [00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,760] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 我给我最好的几个朋友
Segment #9   [00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:13,480] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 再去聊
Segment #10  [00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:16,340] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 12 | Text: 我这人我是一个非常会POA别人的人
Segment #11  [00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,380] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 我就跟他们聊我的梦想
Segment #12  [00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,500] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 我就跟他们聊去了澳门
Segment #13  [00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,800] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 11 | Text: 会对于你们产生怎样的改变
Segment #14  [00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,800] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 13 | Text: 给他们去描绘澳门这个城市的繁华
Segment #15  [00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,580] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为他们没去过
Segment #16  [00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,820] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 我说这个地方钱有多好挣
Segment #17  [00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,980] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 我说你们得跟我走
Segment #18  [00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:25,800] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 2  | Text: 得去
Segment #19  [00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,920] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后没有一个人能听懂我在讲
Segment #20  [00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,920] | Elapsed:  16.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们都听不懂
Segment #21  [00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,080] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们感觉我被骗了
Segment #22  [00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:30,520] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 他们感觉
Segment #23  [00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,700] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 小豆你是不是进船消了
Segment #24  [00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,400] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 你去澳门干啥
Segment #25  [00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,000] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 咱都是农民咱家都种着地
Segment #26  [00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:34,740] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是服务员
Segment #27  [00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,020] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 你是保安咱去的咱干啥
Segment #28  [00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:36,900] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 澳门是长啥样
Segment #29  [00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,300] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 没有一个人能听懂我在讲
Segment #30  [00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:39,300] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后我就自己去了
Segment #31  [00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,060] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 我为什么去
Segment #32  [00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,200] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 是因为我有前瞻性
Segment #33  [00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:41,960] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 我知道这个地方
Segment #34  [00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,500] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 我如果说能站起来
Segment #35  [00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,340] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 我能赚到多少钱
Segment #36  [00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,060] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 我再举个例子
Segment #37  [00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:45,820] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 比如说做互联网
Segment #38  [00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:46,800] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人知道互联网
Segment #39  [00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,800] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 做起来能挣钱
Segment #40  [00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,160] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 他不知道能挣多少钱
Segment #41  [00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:50,880] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 他不知道一个一万粉丝的账号
Segment #42  [00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,160] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 就能变现很多很多
Segment #43  [00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:52,900] | Elapsed:  37.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 他看不到
Segment #44  [00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,920] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 看不到他就不会有动力
Segment #45  [00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,100] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 还有一个就是对于金钱
Segment #46  [00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,060] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 没有迫切的渴望
Segment #47  [00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,060] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人为什么赚不到钱
Segment #48  [00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,580] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是在数据圈里待的太久
Segment #49  [00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:01,680] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 12 | Text: 他没体会过什么叫做背水一战
Segment #50  [00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:02,780] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 你知不知道什么叫做
Segment #51  [00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:04,140] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 上无骗瓦折身
Segment #52  [00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:05,480] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 下无立举之地
Segment #53  [00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:06,660] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 9  | Text: 你只要感受过这个阶段
Segment #54  [00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:07,860] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 你只要是真的穷了
Segment #55  [00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:09,080] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 妈都吃饭饭了
Segment #56  [00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,100] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 都没有钱买大脖子了
Segment #57  [00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:10,520] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #58  [00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,300] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 你已经成了
Segment #59  [00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,380] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 而且我只得有钱
Segment #60  [00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,460] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们还不是真的有钱
Segment #61  [00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:14,800] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 9  | Text: 你们有个几千块几万块
Segment #62  [00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:15,380] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 放在兜里
Segment #63  [00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:16,100] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 好有好多钱
Segment #64  [00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:16,980] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 来饿又饿不死
Segment #65  [00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,200] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 生怕被人骗了
Segment #66  [00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:18,720] | Elapsed:  57.63s | Words: 3  | Text: 生怕出去
Segment #67  [00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:19,280] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 2  | Text: 我出去
Segment #68  [00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,200] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 3  | Text: 我出他们
Segment #69  [00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:20,680] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 我坐在上面
Segment #70  [00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,580] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后我做点生意
Segment #71  [00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:23,000] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 哎呀这我问的都是骗的
Segment #72  [00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,140] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 我这咖喱胆几万块钱
Segment #73  [00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,060] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就太凶手了
Segment #74  [00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:25,540] | Elapsed:  66.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 你们大个人
